OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 15 JUN
OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GA recital from Madrid featuring
OL,6,     Gworks by Ravel, Debussy,
OL,7,     GChabrier, Faure and de Falla.
OL,8,     GJonathan Swain presents.
OL,9,G0630FBreakfast
OL,10,     GTom encounters north Norfolk's
OL,11,     Gwildlife and landscapes through
OL,12,     Gmusic, local voices and the
OL,13,     Gsounds of the natural world. With
OL,14,     Ga live performance by The
OL,15,     GShackleton Trio.
OL,16,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,17,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,18,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,19,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,20,     Gwith familiar favourites.
